{"description":"Equipo salesiano","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Astro_IPISA.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"Information about space missions is usually very convuluted and highly inaccesible for young minds to understand. For this reason, we built Astro Junior, a game concept to help the youth learn about what really goes on inside a space ship in a way that is not only educational, but fun and interactive too.","details":"<p>Astro Junior is a game concept created on Scratch, with the intended impact of being used as an alternative way for learning about space for children and young minds. We consider our project is creative thanks to how we developed it due to our limited coding skills. We considered local impact and the lack of fundamental knowledge in topics such as science and math in our country with the hopes that one day it will help form and educate our astrophysicists, scientists and astronauts of the future</p>","dataRefs":[["NASA Image and Video Library","https://images.nasa.gov/search?q=space%20missions&page=1&media=image&yearStart=1920&yearEnd=2026"],["Radiation Shielding","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SB_7b5sJJco&t=2s"],["Life support","https://www.nasa.gov/reference/jsc-life-support-subsystems/"],["Food administration","https://www.nasa.gov/directorates/esdmd/hhp/space-food-systems/"]],"projectRefs":[["OECD PISA Test Results","https://www.oecd.org/en/about/programmes/pisa.html"],["elCaribe Newspaper","https://www.elcaribe.com.do/panorama/educacion/pisa-2025-rd-estudiantes-nivel-basico-matematicas/#:~:text=El%20promedio%20de%20la%20OCDE%20cay%C3%B3%209,5%20o%206%20en%20matem%C3%A1ticas%20en%20PISA%3F"],["Diario Libre newspaper","https://www.diariolibre.com/actualidad/educacion/2026/08/22/educacion-en-republica-dominicana-y-sus-resultados-de-aprendizaje/3635784#:~:text=Especialmente%20en%20matem%C3%A1ticas%2C%20donde%20despu%C3%A9s%20de%20casi,nivel%20m%C3%ADnimo%20esperado%20al%20terminar%20la%20primaria"],["UNESCO - Global Education Monitoring Report.","https://share.google/RxWFqcX9ru7CUTx9x"]],"members":[{"name":"Khamylle Elizabeth Gutierrez Filpo","country":"Dominican Republic","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/Untitled_eXJACVq.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":true},{"name":"Camila Carenny","country":"Dominican Republic","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/E7069522-185E-4AE6-A424-94FEBEAA7343.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Ashley Fernández Báez","country":"Dominican Republic","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_1274_bNkx4eh.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Smarlyn Hernández Vásquez","country":"Dominican Republic","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_1102_hpoUILT.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false},{"name":"Randaly Peña","country":"Dominican Republic","avatar":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/IMG_0377_ASIpln3.2e16d0ba.fill-64x64.jpg","owner":false}]}